  "job_B8.1.4.2_20251003_114807": {
    "chunk_text": "t \u00feam Egyptyscan wifum, \u00e6t heora neahgeburum & \u00e6t heora \u00deA andswarode Moyses & cw\u00e6\u00f0: Hi ne gelyfa\u00f0 me ne mine stemne ne gehyra\u00fe, ac hi secga\u00fe: Ne Witodlice he cw\u00e6\u00fe to hym: Hw\u00e6t is \u00f0\u00e6t \u00feu h\u00e6fst on \u00feinre handa; \u00fea andswarode he & cw\u00e6\u00f0: Hyt is & Drihten cw\u00e6\u00f0: Wurp hy on \u00fea eor\u00f0an. & he wearp, & heo w\u00e6s gewend to n\u00e6ddran, swa \u00fe\u00e6t Moyses fleah. & Drihten cw\u00e6\u00f0: Astrece \u00feine hand & nim hire steort. & he astrehte hys hand & nam hig, & heo w\u00e6s gewend eft to gyrde, \u00fe\u00e6t hy gelyfon \u00fe\u00e6t Drihten \u00feinra & Drihten cw\u00e6\u00f0: Do \u00feine hand on \u00feinne bosum; \u00fea he hi dide on his bosum, \u00fea brohte he hi for\u00f0 \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 he: Teoh eft \u00feine hand on \u00feinne bosm. \u00dea teah he hig ongean & brohte hi eft ut, & heo w\u00e6s gelic \u00feam o\u00ferum fl\u00e6sce. & he cw\u00e6\u00f0: Gyf hy ne gelyfa\u00f0 \u00f0e, ne ne gehyra\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s \u00e6rran tacnes spr\u00e6ce, hi gelyfa\u00f0 \u00feam worde \u00fe\u00e6s Witodlice gyf hy \u00feyson twam tacnum ne gelyfa\u00f0, ne ne gehyra\u00fe \u00f0ine stemne, nim \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6ter on \u00feam \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 Moyses: Drihten, \u00feu wast n\u00e6s ic n\u00e6fre gespr\u00e6ce, & si\u00fe\u00fean \u00feu spr\u00e6ce to \u00feynum \u00feeowe ic \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 Drihten to him: Hwa geworhte mannes mu\u00fe o\u00fe\ufffd",
